EDF release copies associated with 153 primary ET exports from the main and pilot cohorts. Main-cohort files use sub-XXXX/; pilot files use sub-pilotNN/ses-NN/. Header dates are neutralized; compressed sample/event records and raw tracker times are preserved. Core ET indexes associate each EDF with its measurement table and JSON metadata. The main-cohort 0038 Track EDF retains its source corruption; its readable portion is supplied as a partial ET export.
